We welcome contributions! Please read our \href{CONTRIBUTING.md}{Contributing Guide} before submitting PRs.

\begin{quote}
\textbf{Note for contributors:} All PRs must include tests and pass CI checks. Run \texttt{make\ format} before committing.
\end{quote}

